      "data": {
        "text": "ALADFAR / ALTERNATING CORE VCO\n\nPlay chords using QWERTY / ZXCVB keyboard rows.\n\nOffset=50%, Balance=0% gives a saw.\nTry Balance and Offset together.\n\nResonance feeds the modeled grid circuits. I/II selects the return route; pitch compensation keeps the core tuned.\n\nSmooth/Fold drives saturation and folding. At zero, both processed outputs are silent.\n\nThe scopes compare Raw/Pulse and Smooth/Fold. Move the VCA audio cable between oscillator outputs to listen.\n\nChoose your output device in Audio 2. All inputs support 16 voices."
      }
    },
